    {
      "question_id": "Q9",
      "question": "How do I start the ingestion worker?",
      "category": "how_to",
      "result": {
        "answer": "To start the ingestion worker, you can try the following steps:\n\n1. Clear Redis queues:\n```\ndocker-compose exec redis redis-cli DEL ingestion_queue\n```\n2. Find and review ingestion worker code:\n\t* Check if there are any errors or issues in the ingestion worker code.\n\t* Review the code to ensure it is running correctly.\n3. Add debug logging to worker:\n\t* Add logging statements to the worker code to help diagnose the issue.\n4. Test with a single simple document:\n\t* Create a simple document and test the worker with it.\n\t* Check if the worker processes the document correctly.\n\nIf these steps don't work, you can also try restarting the service with fresh code if needed.",
